  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个由Serilum制作的模组。用心制作。大量活跃的Fabric、Forge和Neo模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">村庄出生点是一个极简模组，它使得新世界的出生点始终位于村庄中心。选择的村庄将是离x=0,z=0最近的村庄。奖励箱世界生成功能与之兼容。如果启用，另一个奖励箱将放置在村庄出生点周围。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要Collective模组\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于The Vanilla Experience整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于Serilum的RPG组合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>locateVillageTag</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"#minecraft:village\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">用于定位村庄结构的标签。可更改以提高与模组村庄的兼容性。这与'/locate structure '命令中使用的标签相同。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>keepDefaultVillageTagBackup</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果在'locateVillageTag'中输入了自定义值，且无法找到出生点时，将使用'#minecraft:village'作为后备值。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模组兼容</span> <span style=\"color:#396;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#396;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-spawn-point\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Spawn Point</a></span>。</p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载文件仍托管于CurseForge或Modrinth生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已关闭，因为我无法在这么多独立的模组页面上追踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
